><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1782"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="555D66"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Students for Ireland and UK master’s intakes across four cities. Volume was never the problem, but fewer than half the leads were usable. I rebuilt the lead form to filter rather than collect, put eligibility and cost expectations into the ad copy itself, and ran a weekly quality review with the counselling team. The share of usable leads moved from roughly 45% to 65% on the same spend.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="7" name="Shape 5"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="745236" y="4466844"/><a:ext cx="5120640" cy="1592132"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="ECEFF1"/></a:solidFill><a:ln w="12700"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="ECEFF1"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:sp><p:pic><p:nvPicPr><p:cNvPr id="8" name="Image 0" descr="/home/claude/shots/ns_table.png"/><p:cNvPicPr><a:picLocks noChangeAspect="1"/></p:cNvPicPr><p:nvPr/></p:nvPicPr><p:blipFill><a:blip r:embed="rId3"/><a:stretch><a:fillRect/></a:stretch></p:blipFill><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="713232" y="4434840"/><a:ext cx="5120640" cy="1592132"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr></p:pic><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="9" name="Shape 6"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6172200" y="2011680"/><a:ext cx="8230" cy="3931920"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E4E7EA"/></a:solidFill><a:ln w="12700"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E4E7EA"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="10" name="Text 7"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6675120" y="2011680"/><a:ext cx="4754880" cy="274320"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1500" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2B3138"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Georgia" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Georgia" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Georgia" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Cheenti Digital, my own agency</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1500" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="11" name="Text 8"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6675120" y="2331720"/><a:ext cx="4754880" cy="237744"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1000" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="8A929B"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Google Ads  ·  ₹14.2 lakh  ·  20 months  ·  989 conversions</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1000" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="12" name="Text 9"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6675120" y="2697480"/><a:ext cx="4754880" cy="1554480"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p: